# --- Generated report assets: DELIBERATELY TRACKED ------------------------------
# Overleaf receives these through Git, so they must NOT be ignored:
#     figures/generated/          (figures written by Python, e.g. *.pdf)
#     report/tables/generated/    (LaTeX tables written by Python, *.tex)
# Do not add broad patterns (e.g. *.pdf, *.png, *.tex) above without checking
# `git check-ignore -v figures/generated/x.pdf report/tables/generated/x.tex`.
